ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rparrett/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rparrett/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rparrett/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rparrett/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-10-25T20:20:41Z","label":{"name":"A-Rendering","color":"C6A751"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1780448181","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/10267#issuecomment-1780448181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/10267","id":1780448181,"node_id":"IC_kwDODf6-U85qH3u1","user":{"login":"robojeb","id":1207581,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDc1ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1207581?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb","html_url":"https://github.com/robojeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-26T05:40:03Z","updated_at":"2023-10-26T05:40:03Z","body":"I think the issue is here in `get_vertex_buffer_data()`:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nfor attribute_data in self.attributes.values().take(vertex_count) { // <<<<\r\n // <snip>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis limits the number of attribute buffers that will be iterated over, not the number of values in the attribute itself. \r\nThe inner loop over chunks of data from the attribute buffer should have the `.take(vertex_count)`. \r\n\r\n```diff\r\n- for (vertex_index, attribute_bytes) in\r\n-                attributes_bytes.chunks_exact(attribute_size).enumerate()\r\n+ for (vertex_index, attribute_bytes) in\r\n+                attributes_bytes.chunks_exact(attribute_size).take(vertex_count).enumerate()\r\n```\r\n\r\nQuick testing shows that moving the `.take()` into the inner loop prevents the crash. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1780448181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"robojeb","id":1207581,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDc1ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1207581?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb","html_url":"https://github.com/robojeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"robojeb","id":1207581,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDc1ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1207581?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robojeb","html_url":